<h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
<p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> [Insert Date]</p>

<p>
    This Cookie Policy explains how Anaya 3D Prints uses cookies and similar tracking technologies to
    improve your browsing experience.
</p>

<h2>What Are Cookies?</h2>
<p>
    Cookies are small files stored on your device when you browse websites. They help websites remember 
    preferences, analyze traffic, and improve functionality.
</p>

<h2>Types of Cookies We Use</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Essential Cookies:</strong> Required for the site to function properly.</li>
    <li><strong>Performance Cookies:</strong> Used for analytics tools such as Google Analytics.</li>
    <li><strong>Functional Cookies:</strong> Remember preferences such as language and viewing settings.</li>
    <li><strong>Advertising Cookies:</strong> (If enabled) Used for targeted ads and remarketing.</li>
</ul>

<h2>How We Use Cookies</h2>
<p>
    Cookies help us:
</p>
<ul>
    <li>Understand how visitors use our website</li>
    <li>Improve functionality and layout</li>
    <li>Enhance user experience</li>
    <li>Store basic user preferences</li>
</ul>

<h2>Managing Cookies</h2>
<p>
    You can control or delete cookies through your browser settings. Disabling cookies may impact
    certain site features.
</p>

<h2>Third‑Party Cookies</h2>
<p>
    Some cookies may come from third‑party services such as analytics tools. These providers have their own privacy policies.
</p>

<h2>Updates to This Cookie Policy</h2>
<p>
    We may update this policy when we change site functionality or tracking tools. The date above will always reflect the latest version.
</p>

<h2>Contact Us</h2>
